103 Include the Jacobian of the convection term u.grad(gammap) with respect to
    the velocity for the Newton-Raphson iteration scheme in the routine
    implicit_gammap_supg_elem:
    0: no
    1: yes
    NOTE: In implicit_ce_supg_elem the Jacobian of the convection term
          u.grad(gammap) with respect to the velocity is not performed and
          part of the routine implicit_ce_vel_supg_elem. 
    NOTE: By setting coefficients%i(91)=0 and coefficients%i(103)=0, the
          routine implicit_gammap_supg_elem can be used to iterate only on the
          conformation and the plastic strain gammap and keeping
          the velocity constant during iteration.

104--150 Reserved for future use. Set to zero for future compatibility.
